<title>ITALY: SOCCER-BARCELONA BEAT FIORENTINA 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA BEAT FIORENTINA 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona of Spain beat Fiorentina of Italy 2-0 on Thursday in their Cup Winners' Cup semifinal second leg (halftime 2-0).</p>
<p>Barcelona win 3-1 on aggregate and qualify for the final against Paris St Germain in Rotterdam on May 14.</p>
<p>Scorers - Fernando Couto 30, Josep Guardiola 35.</p>
<p>Attendance: 48,000</p>
